      "instance_name": "shaving_cream",
      "label": "shaving_cream",
      "description": "A foamy substance used to lubricate the skin before shaving to reduce irritation and allow the razor to glide smoothly. In the meme, it is used to cover the scalp, visually reinforcing the idea that the man is 'shaving' his head, which is part of the visual metaphor for his 'sunscreen'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_36d5e045"
