      "instance_name": "absurd_analogical_mapping",
      "label": "absurd_analogical_mapping",
      "description": "A humorous or illogical comparison used to create a joke or satire. In this meme, the bald head is absurdly equated with sunscreen, which is a form of analogical mapping that relies on a false or exaggerated similarity to generate humor. This is a common comedic device in internet memes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
