      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "self_deprecating_joke",
      "label": "self_deprecating_joke",
      "description": "A joke that makes fun of oneself, often to create humor through humility or absurdity. The meme's humor comes from the man's self-deprecating claim that his bald head is his sunscreen, which is an exaggerated and illogical statement.",
