      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "bald head as sunscreen",
      "description": "The top text 'why don't i get sunburnt' is mapped onto the visual of the man's bald head, which is humorously presented as his 'sunscreen'. The visual of the shaved scalp, covered in shaving cream and being shaved with a razor, is used to create an absurd analogical mapping where the absence of hair is equated with the function of sunscreen to prevent sunburn.",
