      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the man in the image",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the man (VisualMaterial entity) who is shaving his scalp. The humor of the meme relies on the user identifying with the man's situation and his self-deprecating joke about his bald head being 'sunscreen'. The text 'why don't i get sunburnt' and 'i use sunscreen' explicitly uses 'i' to create a direct identification with the subject of the image, making the user project themselves onto the man.",
